{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "aiops-overview",
  "title": "AI Ops Overview",
  "description": "Request rate, error rate, latency (P50/P95), and eval quality metrics across llm-gateway, rag-service, agent-service, and eval-service. Each service defines its own metric names/namespace (no shared http_requests_total convention across services), so panels use one query per service rather than a single grouped-by-service query. See README.md for the exact metric names this was built against.",
  "tags": [
    "aiops",
    "prometheus"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate by Service (req/s)",
      "description": "One query per service, since each service names its own request counter: llm_gateway_requests_total, rag_query_total, agent_service_chat_requests_total, eval_runs_total.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(llm_gateway_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "llm-gateway"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(rag_query_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rag-service (queries)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_service_chat_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "agent-service (chat)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(rate(eval_runs_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "eval-service (eval runs)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error Rate by Service (fraction of failed requests)",
      "description": "llm-gateway: status label is success|error|chaos_error, both error states counted. agent-service: status label is ok|error. rag-service is intentionally EXCLUDED -- its rag_query_total counter currently carries no status/outcome label, so an error ratio isn't derivable from it today (a real, concrete instrumentation gap worth fixing). eval-service uses eval_runs_total{result=\"fail\"} as its 'error' proxy -- a failed eval run isn't a service error, but it's the closest available signal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(llm_gateway_requests_total{status=~\"error|chaos_error\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(llm_gateway_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "llm-gateway"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_service_chat_requests_total{status=\"error\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(agent_service_chat_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "agent-service"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(eval_runs_total{result=\"fail\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(eval_runs_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "eval-service (fail rate)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Latency P50 by Service",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.50, ...) against each service's own latency histogram: llm_gateway_request_latency_seconds, rag_query_latency_seconds, agent_service_chat_latency_seconds, eval_run_latency_seconds.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(llm_gateway_request_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "llm-gateway"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(rag_query_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "rag-service"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(agent_service_chat_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "agent-service"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(eval_run_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "eval-service"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Latency P95 by Service",
      "description": "Same histograms as the P50 panel, 95th percentile instead.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(llm_gateway_request_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "llm-gateway"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(rag_query_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "rag-service"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(agent_service_chat_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "agent-service"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(eval_run_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "eval-service"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Eval Quality (eval-service)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Eval Pass Rate",
      "description": "eval_pass_rate is a gauge labeled by scenario (plus an 'overall' aggregate); this panel shows the overall aggregate, range 0-1.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "eval_pass_rate{scenario=\"overall\"}",
          "legendFormat": "pass rate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Eval Avg Score",
      "description": "eval_avg_score is the judge's score_percent averaged across runs, already on a 0-100 scale (not 0-1) -- this panel shows the overall aggregate.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "eval_avg_score{scenario=\"overall\"}",
          "legendFormat": "avg score"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Service Up",
      "description": "up{job=~...} -- 1 means Prometheus successfully scraped that service's /metrics on the last attempt. Job names come from prometheus.yml's job_name fields, which match docker-compose service names.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=~\"llm-gateway|rag-service|agent-service|eval-service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cost (llm-gateway) -- illustrative rates, see app/metrics.py",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Estimated Cost Rate by Provider ($/min)",
      "description": "rate(llm_gateway_cost_usd_total[5m]) * 60 -- derived from llm_gateway_tokens_total via the static $/1K-token table in app/metrics.py's COST_PER_1K_TOKENS_USD. Illustrative rates, not real-time provider pricing -- update that table to match your actual contracted rates before trusting this for a real budget decision.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rate(llm_gateway_cost_usd_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total Estimated Cost (since last restart)",
      "description": "sum(llm_gateway_cost_usd_total) -- a cumulative counter, so this resets to 0 whenever llm-gateway restarts. Illustrative rates, see the timeseries panel's description.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(llm_gateway_cost_usd_total)",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}